### Category and product requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
### click "Send Request" above each request. Run them top to bottom: later requests
### use the ids created by earlier ones.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### All categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### Create a category (ProductCategory entity, repository save())
# @name category
POST {{base}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lemmikit", "description": "Lemmikkieläinten tarvikkeet" }

### Read it back
GET {{base}}/categories/{{category.response.body.$.id}}

### Update it
PUT {{base}}/categories/{{category.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lemmikit", "description": "Ruoat ja tarvikkeet lemmikeille" }

### Create a product in the new category
# @name product
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kissan raapimapuu",
  "description": "Korkea raapimapuu",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stockQuantity": 12,
  "categoryId": {{category.response.body.$.id}},
  "supplierId": 59
}

### Update the product (sends back the version it loaded: optimistic locking)
PUT {{base}}/products/{{product.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kissan raapimapuu XL",
  "description": "Korkea raapimapuu",
  "price": 59.90,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "categoryId": {{category.response.body.$.id}},
  "supplierId": 59,
  "version": {{product.response.body.$.version}}
}

### Search: products in stock in the new category
GET {{base}}/products?categoryId={{category.response.body.$.id}}&inStock=true

### Deleting the category fails while it has products: 409
DELETE {{base}}/categories/{{category.response.body.$.id}}

### Delete the product, then the category
DELETE {{base}}/products/{{product.response.body.$.id}}

###
DELETE {{base}}/categories/{{category.response.body.$.id}}

### A product that is on orders can't be deleted: 409
DELETE {{base}}/products/2


### Bulk price change (assignment 13, JPQL UPDATE): +10 % to every product in category 3
POST {{base}}/products/bulk/price?categoryId=3&factor=1.10


### Bulk restock (assignment 13, Criteria API): two conditions
POST {{base}}/products/bulk/restock?amount=50&categoryId=3&stockBelow=50

